# Prettier already honours .gitignore, so build output, coverage/, test-results/ and
# node_modules/ need no entry here. This file is only for artifacts that ARE committed but are
# produced by a generator — formatting them makes the committed copy diverge from what the
# generator emits, and `npm run docs:api:check` / `docs:openapi:check` then fail in CI.
docs/api-reference-generated.md
docs/openapi.generated.json
docs/dependency-licenses.generated.json

# Playwright visual baselines
apps/web/tests/e2e/**/*-snapshots/
